// MISTAKE: `expenses/grocries` is a full path under a root, so it silently opens a
// new account; the real one is `expenses/groceries`. Nothing is reported.
base USD
use std

account assets/checking : bank
account expenses/groceries
account equity/opening

2025-12-31 equity/opening -> checking 1_000 USD
2026-01-08 checking -> expenses/groceries 84.20 USD
2026-01-15 checking -> expenses/grocries 97.10 USD
